@startuml ProximaDB Communication Diagram
!theme plain
title ProximaDB - Component Communication Diagram

participant "Client" as C
participant "REST/gRPC Handler" as H
participant "Vector Service" as VS
participant "Collection Service" as CS
participant "Storage Coordinator" as SC
participant "WAL Manager" as WAL
participant "Storage Engine" as SE
participant "AXIS Manager" as AXIS
participant "Search Factory" as SF
participant "Metrics Collector" as MC

== Asynchronous Insert Flow ==

C ->> H : 1: insert_vectors(request)
activate H

H ->> VS : 2: insert_batch(collection_id, vectors)
activate VS

VS ->> CS : 3: get_collection_config(id)
activate CS
CS -->> VS : 3.1: collection_config
deactivate CS

VS ->> SC : 4: validate_and_prepare(vectors, config)
activate SC
SC -->> VS : 4.1: prepared_batch
deactivate SC

VS ->> WAL : 5: append_async(batch)
activate WAL
WAL -->> VS : 5.1: write_handle
deactivate WAL

VS ->> AXIS : 6: queue_index_update(vectors)
activate AXIS
AXIS -->> VS : 6.1: update_queued
deactivate AXIS

VS -->> H : 7: success_response
deactivate VS

H -->> C : 8: HTTP 200 OK
deactivate H

note over WAL : Background flush\nto storage

WAL ->> SE : 9: flush_batch_async()
activate SE
SE ->> MC : 9.1: report_flush_metrics()
SE -->> WAL : 9.2: flush_complete
deactivate SE

== Synchronous Search Flow ==

C ->> H : 10: search_vectors(query)
activate H

H ->> VS : 11: search_polymorphic(params)
activate VS

VS ->> SF : 12: create_search_engine(collection)
activate SF
SF -->> VS : 12.1: polymorphic_engine
deactivate SF

VS ->> WAL : 13: search_unflushed()
activate WAL
WAL -->> VS : 13.1: wal_results
deactivate WAL

VS ->> SE : 14: search_storage()
activate SE
SE ->> MC : 14.1: report_search_metrics()
SE -->> VS : 14.2: storage_results
deactivate SE

VS ->> SC : 15: deduplicate_merge(results)
activate SC
SC -->> VS : 15.1: final_results
deactivate SC

VS -->> H : 16: search_response
deactivate VS

H -->> C : 17: HTTP 200 OK
deactivate H

== Event-Driven Communications ==

SE ->> SC : 18: compaction_needed
SC ->> SE : 18.1: start_compaction()

AXIS ->> SC : 19: index_optimized
SC ->> MC : 19.1: report_optimization()

WAL ->> MC : 20: wal_full_event
MC ->> VS : 20.1: trigger_emergency_flush()

== Monitoring Communications ==

MC <<-- VS : metrics.vector_ops
MC <<-- WAL : metrics.wal_stats
MC <<-- SE : metrics.storage_stats
MC <<-- AXIS : metrics.index_stats

note over MC
  Aggregates metrics
  for Prometheus export
end note

== Error Handling Communications ==

VS -x H : error: collection_not_found
H -x C : HTTP 404

SE -x VS : error: storage_full
VS -x H : error: service_unavailable
H -x C : HTTP 503

note right of C
  Communication Patterns:
  1. Request-Response (sync)
  2. Fire-and-Forget (async)
  3. Event-Driven (pub-sub)
  4. Streaming (gRPC only)
end note

@enduml